The doorbell rings.
I open the door.
Neha and Amit are standing outside.
I invite them inside.
"Welcome, come in!" I say.
"Thank you, Maya," Amit says.
"Your flat is very nice," Neha says.
"Thank you, please sit here," I say.
I point towards my small dining table.
They both sit on the chairs.
"First, I will bring some water," I tell them.
I go to the kitchen.
From there, I bring a jug of water.
Then, I place three glasses on the table.
After that, I bring three plates and spoons.
I pour water into everyone's glass.
"Are you both hungry?" I ask.
"Yes, a lot!"
"What have you made for the meal?" Neha asks.
"I have made Kande Pohe," I answer with a smile.
I bring the food from the kitchen.
